OL,3,GNEWSARSPCA to rebuild animal shelter
OL,4,Aafter 46 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RSPCA has begun redeveloping a
OL,7,Frescue shelter that has offered
OL,8,Frehoming services for nearly 50 years.
OL,10,FYork Animal Home on Landing Lane in
OL,11,FClifton is the city's main cattery and
OL,12,Fpuppy unit, but the site near the River
OL,13,FOuse is prone to flooding.
OL,15,FDemolition work has already started and
OL,16,Fthe buildings will be replaced with
OL,17,Fmodern facilities as part of the #5m
OL,18,Fproject.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
