OL,3,GNEWSARSPCA to rebuild animal shelter
OL,4,Aafter 46 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity's campaign manager, Lucy
OL,7,FLowthian, said the centre still needed
OL,8,Fto raise #800,000 from donations to
OL,9,Fcontinue its work.
